The generated OpenAPI documents will live here — FastAPI's exported internal schema (/internal/v1)
and the public Laravel API document (kb-internal-api-contracts DoD). Both are intended as
generate-and-COMMIT targets, which is why this directory is outside every gitignored path.

NEITHER EXISTS YET, and nothing generates or validates them: this directory holds only .gitkeep,
there is no export command on either side, and gates.yml has no step over packages/. Treat the
paragraph below as the contract to build, not as a description of a running pipeline.

Nothing in here is hand-edited. Laravel's internal client is to be generated or validated from the
FastAPI document; src/resources/ from the public one. The commit-and-diff check that makes that
real (re-generate in CI, fail on `git diff --exit-code`) belongs in ci.yml, which has not been
authored — until it is, a document that drifts from the code it describes drifts silently.
